"Biller catalogue expansion: Continue the phased onboarding of billers through the 1-Link/1BILL and Kuickpay aggregator networks, widening category and biller coverage for users across the portfolio.",
"NTL (NADRA) integration as a fallback rail: Integrate NTL as a secondary processing path for billers that are live on both 1-Link and NADRA. If 1-Link is down or returns an error for any reason, the transaction will automatically be routed through NADRA instead of failing outright \u2014 reducing failure-driven drop-off and improving overall reliability for these billers.",
"Track the impact of the Bill Payment Revamp and the NTL fallback mechanism on success rate and user retention once live, and report back with updated figures.",
